function setReplaySeekingUiI626(on){const locked=!!on;for(const id of ['replayStartV415','replayPlayV415','replayStopV415','replayTimelineV415','replayPeriodV415']){const el=$(id);if(el)el.disabled=locked}const p=$('replayPeriodV415');if(p)refreshReplayCustomSelect('replayPeriodV415');updateReplayJumpAvailabilityI624();updateReplaySearchAvailabilityI621();updateReplaySearchNavI621();qa('.replay-search-result-i621').forEach(el=>el.disabled=locked);if(locked)setStatus('Seeking Replay state…',true)}
